      "raw": "In the first scene of the first issue of the starter kit, the players are fighting a group of  mechanical spiders. The game suggests some twist examples, involving hindering or damaging heroes with a min die, or max for a major twist.\r\n\r\nThe issue is that the environment doesn't have any dice. Am I missing something, or was this an oversight? If I am missing something, what am I rolling? The starter guide has a thing about rolling d4s if nothing applies, but that seems to be geared towards hero overcome checks.",
